<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103001" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pertaining to the supreme end</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθὰ τ</span>. (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιητικά</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.25
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφάλαια τ</span>. topics
				<i>drawn from these goods</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> more
			generally, <i>connected with final</i> or <i>intentional
				causality</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. αἴτιον</span>,
				= Aristotle's <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὗ
			ἕνεκα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.612
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>in Ti.</u>
				3.126
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>; in Medicine, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Febr.</u>
				23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>in the end</i> or <i>termination</i> of a word, <i><span class="en">
				Clearch.
				63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				632.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				289.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>perfect</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τελικὴν φιλίας
			ἕξιν</span> prob.in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Acad.Ind.</u>
				p.56
			</span></i> M.</div>
